<title>BDPNT: Obtain PNT points from a database (local or remote)</title>
<meta content="text/html; charset=ISO-8859-1" http-equiv="Content-Type"/>
</head>

<body>
<a id="MENU" name="MENU"></a>
<!--Aquí inicia la part corresponent al titol de la MSA. Aquesta part s'ha d'editar desde el document WPS (aplicacio.mps).-->
<h1><span id="wpstitol"/></h1>
<p><ul>
<h4>Direct access to online <a href="https://www.miramon.cat/help/eng/" target="_blank">help</a>: <a href="https://www.miramon.cat/help/eng/msa/BDPNT.htm" target="_blank"><font size="+2">BDPNT</font></a></h4>
<h4>Access the application from the menu: <br> 
<i>"File | Import | Vector and/or databases | DBF, Access, etc -> PNT"</i><br>
<i>"File | Export | PNT -> DBF (x,y,z)"</i><br>  
<i>"Tools | File maintenance | Obtain points from DBF table, Access, etc"</i></h4>
</ul></p>
<!--Aquí acaba la part corresponent titol de la MSA editable de el WPS.-->

